use std :: process :: Command ; use std :: env ; use std :: ffi :: OsString ; use std :: sync :: { LazyLock , Mutex , MutexGuard } ; use super :: * ; # [doc = " Checks if running in VS Code terminal"] # [doc = ""] # [doc = " Detects VS Code by checking for environment variables that are set"] # [doc = " when running in the VS Code integrated terminal."] pub fn is_vscode_terminal () -> bool { std :: env :: var ("TERM_PROGRAM") . map (| val | val == "vscode") . unwrap_or (false) || std :: env :: var ("VSCODE_PID") . is_ok () || std :: env :: var ("VSCODE_GIT_ASKPASS_NODE") . is_ok () || std :: env :: var ("VSCODE_GIT_IPC_HANDLE") . is_ok () }